commit 3496df0ffb0635a998a8dc26d9f5fc66a9877a37
Merge: 08c940d a47894a
Author: wangqi <wang.qi@qikuyx.com>
Date:   Sun Jun 7 19:30:15 2026 -0400

    Merge upstream main (tag-20260522 audio/Gemma4/MoE work), resolving six conflicts: keep the wangqi tool-call fields + audios in Chat.Message, integrate pendingOutput invisible-start-tag buffering with upstream's taggedStartMode/bareJSON path plus fallbackParser in ToolCallProcessor, flush both pendingOutput and processEOS buffers at EOS in Evaluate, put the XMLFunction fallback in JSONToolCallParser's decode-failure branch under upstream's declared-tool gate, adopt upstream's kvState enum in Gemma4Text, and keep the iOS chunked prefill (state nil) alongside upstream's MROPE state-seeding for non-iOS in Qwen25VL.

