commit e8323413eda5c5da0aeaaeb5254db3bf4116ca6f
Author: NivDvir <30941690+NivDvir@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Wed May 27 17:28:52 2026 +0300

    Fix Qwen2-VL chat template: emit vision tokens before text (#242)
    
    Fix Qwen2-VL chat template: emit vision tokens before text
    
    Qwen2VLMessageGenerator was emitting text before image content, shifting
    image-token positions and skewing MROPE position IDs. This caused a
    deterministic +9 px bbox offset vs the mlx-vlm reference. Reordering to
    match HuggingFace's template (image before text) makes Swift bbox output
    bit-exact on canonical test images.

